'''Jaguar warriors''' are enemies encountered in [[Fortis Colosseum]]. Similarly to [[nail beast]]s, their attacks consist of three hits on the player, with each hit having its own independent accuracy and strength roll. This means it is possible for the warrior to instantly kill the player with one attack if all three accuracy rolls succeed and the damage roll is sufficiently high enough.

These enemies only appear as reinforcements during the first six waves of the Colosseum if the player does not clear the wave within 40 seconds.

